  "story": {
    "title": "Amma! Amma!",
    "paragraphs_en": [
      "\"I need nails and some rope. And flowers,\"says Amma.",
      "So Appa takes Ashok and Baby to the market.",
      "\"Amma!\" \"No, Baby! That's not Amma. Amma has long, black hair,\"says Appa.",
      "\"Amma!\" \" No, Baby! Amma does not have a beard.\"",
      "\"Amma!\" \" No, Baby. Amma is not old. Amma is young,\" says Appa.",
      "T h ey go home with the nails, rope and flowers.",
      "T ak -tak-taphaak! Look! Amma has made a cart for Baby!",
      "Baby thought of Amma when she saw the girl, the man with a beard and the old lady at the market. I know why Baby thought she saw Amma at the market. Do you?",
      "Clever Baby!"
    ],
    "sentences": [
      {
        "text_en": "\"I need nails and some rope.",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_113464/s_000.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Mẹ cần đinh và một ít dây thừng."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "And flowers,\"says Amma.",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_113464/s_001.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Và hoa nữa,\" Amma nói."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "So Appa takes Ashok and Baby to the market.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_113464/s_002.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Thế là bố Appa đưa Ashok và Baby ra chợ."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "\"Amma!\" \"No, Baby!",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_113464/s_003.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Mẹ Amma!\" \"Không phải đâu, Baby!"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "That's not Amma.",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_113464/s_004.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Đó không phải là mẹ Amma."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Amma has long, black hair,\"says Appa.",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_113464/s_005.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Mẹ Amma có tóc dài, đen mà,\" bố Appa nói."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "\"Amma!\" \" No, Baby!",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_113464/s_006.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Mẹ Amma!\" \"Không phải đâu, Baby!"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Amma does not have a beard.\"",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_113464/s_007.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Mẹ Amma không có râu đâu."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "\"Amma!\" \" No, Baby.",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_113464/s_008.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Mẹ Amma!\" \"Không phải đâu, Baby."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Amma is not old.",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_113464/s_009.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Mẹ Amma không già."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Amma is young,\" says Appa.",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_113464/s_010.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Mẹ Amma còn trẻ mà,\" bố Appa nói."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "T h ey go home with the nails, rope and flowers.",
        "paragraph_index": 5,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_113464/s_011.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Họ về nhà với đinh, dây thừng và hoa."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "T ak -tak-taphaak!",
        "paragraph_index": 6,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_113464/s_012.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Tắc-tắc-tập-phạch!"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Look! Amma has made a cart for Baby!",
        "paragraph_index": 6,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_113464/s_013.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Nhìn kìa! Mẹ Amma đã làm một chiếc xe đẩy cho Baby!"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Baby thought of Amma when she saw the girl, the man with a beard and the old lady at the market.",
        "paragraph_index": 7,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_113464/s_014.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Baby đã nghĩ đến mẹ Amma khi bé nhìn thấy cô gái, người đàn ông có râu và bà cụ ở chợ."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "I know why Baby thought she saw Amma at the market. Do you?",
        "paragraph_index": 7,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_113464/s_015.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Tớ biết tại sao Baby lại nghĩ bé nhìn thấy mẹ Amma ở chợ đấy. Cậu có biết không?"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Clever Baby!",
        "paragraph_index": 8,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_113464/s_016.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Baby thông minh quá!"
      }
    ]
  },
